OL,3,GNEWSAChild left with face and body
OL,4,Ainjuries after 'deplorable' sectarian
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FA boy has been left with injuries to
OL,8,Fhis face and body following a
OL,9,F"sectarian-motivated" attack by three
OL,10,Fmasked males in Londonderry.
OL,12,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,13,F(PSNI) said the victim was walking
OL,14,Falong Limavady Road area of the city at
OL,15,Fabout 22:30 GMT on Saturday, when three
OL,16,Fmales, dressed in dark clothing with
OL,17,Ftheir faces covered, got out of a black
OL,18,Fparked car and attacked him.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
