OL,3,GNEWSAChild left with face and body
OL,4,Ainjuries after 'deplorable' sectarian
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is reported one of these males
OL,8,Fpunched the boy in the face, which
OL,9,Fknocked him to the ground before he was
OL,10,Fthen kicked by all three males.
OL,12,FDUP councillor Chelsie Cooke described
OL,13,Fthe incident as "absolutely
OL,14,Fdisgusting", adding no child "should
OL,15,Fever be subjected to such hatred and
OL,16,Fviolence."
